{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03555",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.36,
      "end_seconds": 3.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "welcome make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.95,
      "end_seconds": 7.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "So, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.0,
      "end_seconds": 11.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "lovely day outside, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.59,
      "end_seconds": 18.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "It, It is, I almost forgot I was coming here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.0,
      "end_seconds": 24.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.31,
      "end_seconds": 38.71,
      "duration_seconds": 12.4,
      "text": "Okay, so honestly, it's being very stressed, and my family pushed me to come. I didn't wanna make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.95,
      "end_seconds": 45.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.79,
      "end_seconds": 50.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "About... well, about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.97,
      "end_seconds": 55.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Right, is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.14,
      "end_seconds": 61.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I'd give it a three, out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.83,
      "end_seconds": 65.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.72,
      "end_seconds": 82.93,
      "duration_seconds": 16.21,
      "text": "Okay, um, so it usually comes with shaking when I try to walk. Yeah, you know, the shaking when I try to walk? That's been for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.53,
      "end_seconds": 85.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Any tingling as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.27,
      "end_seconds": 90.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "okay, so yes, for about four days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.89,
      "end_seconds": 94.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.42,
      "end_seconds": 99.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "It, It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.75,
      "end_seconds": 125.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Have you had any loss of bladder control, headache, visual loss or back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.96,
      "end_seconds": 136.31,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "Oh, you know, I haven't had loss of bladder control, headache, visual loss or back pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.85,
      "end_seconds": 141.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.88,
      "end_seconds": 146.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "right, I move fine otherwise"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.09,
      "end_seconds": 151.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.86,
      "end_seconds": 154.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.98,
      "end_seconds": 160.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.25,
      "end_seconds": 172.49,
      "duration_seconds": 10.24,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I swim twice a week. I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.65,
      "end_seconds": 177.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.53,
      "end_seconds": 187.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "It's sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.0,
      "end_seconds": 208.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.66,
      "end_seconds": 211.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "yes, trimethoprim"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.21,
      "end_seconds": 221.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Alright, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.19,
      "end_seconds": 228.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Let me think, I've had migraines for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.89,
      "end_seconds": 235.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.38,
      "end_seconds": 250.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.48,
      "end_seconds": 284.63,
      "duration_seconds": 12.15,
      "text": "okay: SpO2 98 percent on room air, temperature is 36.4 degrees and pulse is 86 beats a minute, pressure 113 over 68, respiratory rate 14."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.0,
      "end_seconds": 289.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "is that alright, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.89,
      "end_seconds": 293.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.96,
      "end_seconds": 299.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.36,
      "end_seconds": 301.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.06,
      "end_seconds": 306.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.66,
      "end_seconds": 328.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "The leg gives way on testing but the strength returns when you are distracted, and the reflexes are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.39,
      "end_seconds": 340.41,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up now. Putting it all together, the most likely explanation is a likely functional neurological disorder."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.31,
      "end_seconds": 345.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "so, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.23,
      "end_seconds": 359.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.26,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a a likely functional neurological disorder do well once it's treated properly. Let's get blood tests, for neurological symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 360.53,
      "end_seconds": 363.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "The earliest is Wednesday, 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.13,
      "end_seconds": 398.0,
      "duration_seconds": 29.87,
      "text": "I'm sending you for an MRI scan because of leg weakness. This is real and treatable, the nervous system is working differently, not damaged. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. We'll catch up after the scan."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.73,
      "end_seconds": 402.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.94,
      "end_seconds": 409.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.0,
      "end_seconds": 418.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.24,
      "end_seconds": 420.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}